      {
        "n": "Confusing Mix w/ Jamen Whitelock - Asia Records Special",
        "s": "2026-11-06T20:00:00Z",
        "e": "2026-11-06T21:00:00Z",
        "d": "Lock in for a monthly transmission of leftfield sonics from Josh Da Costa live from LA.\nFrom the host: \"Asia Records was Taiwan’s first record label, founded by five brothers in 1950s Tainan. Known for preserving Taiwanese folk music through melodies paired with Taiwanese Hokkien lyrics, its recordings capture a haunting blend of nostalgia and joy. This mix is an ode to my family and motherland.\"",
